# The update strip's words. Placeholders ({ $name }) must stay; their order may change.

## The strip's states.
banner-checking = Checking for updates…
banner-up-to-date = You have the latest version.
# { $version } is the new release's version ("2.4.0").
banner-available = Version { $version } is available.
banner-downloading = Downloading the update…
banner-ready = The update is ready.

## Its buttons, and the progress bar's name for screen readers.
banner-install = Install
banner-restart = Restart now
banner-progress = Downloading update
